<h1><a href='https://uknowledge.uky.edu/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1078&amp;context=biology_etds'>CELLULAR BIOENERGETICS REGULATES CELL PROLIFERATION DURING  MAMMALIAN REGENERATION</a></h1>
</div>
<div class='clear'></div>
<div id='authors' class='element'>
<h2 class='visually-hidden'>Author</h2>
